      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Magnificent and generously proportioned family home on an elevated site of c.1.37 acres of beautifully landscaped and maintained gardens </li><li>Panoramic views of the Irish Sea featuring Dalkey Island and beyond</li><li>Featuring 8 bedrooms (all ensuite), 4 reception rooms, 2 studies, a library, gym with steam room, private tennis court and wine cellar</li><li>Energy efficient A3 BER rating with geothermal underfloor heating and solar panels </li><li>Beautifully presented with premium quality finishes utilised throughout the interiors and exteriors</li><li>Kitchen appliances and gym equipment included as part of the sale</li><li>Triple garage with direct access to the house</li><li>Highly desirable location in Rathmichael, south County Dublin within easy reach of a host of amenities and facilities</li><li>A variety of public transport links close by including Dublin Bus routes, LUAS at Brides Glen and DART at Shankill along with very quick access to M50 for motorists.</li><li>Excellent primary and secondary schools in the locality</ul>"
